OL,3,CToddler seriously injured after
OL,4,Cfalling from first-floor window of
OL,5,Cproperty
OL,7,FA toddler has suffered life-
OL,8,Fthreatening injuries after falling
OL,9,Ffrom the first-floor window of a
OL,10,Fproperty in Balby, Doncaster.
OL,12,FEmergency services responded to Burton
OL,13,FAvenue on Sunday, 26 July at 9.40am
OL,14,Ffollowing reports that a toddler had
OL,15,Ffallen from a first-floor window of a
OL,16,Fproperty.
OL,18,FThe child was taken to hospital with
OL,19,Fserious injuries, where they remain in
OL,20,Fa life-threatening condition.
